    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報324期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">新年ê跤步siuh--一-下來到3--月，天氣mā漸漸仔溫暖--起-來。Tsit期ê逐家來phò-tāu專欄kā lán教講，tio̍h-ài遵守〈婚姻幸福〉ê原則，tsiah ē-tàng像〈Gâu早〉公園內底ê阿公、阿媽仝款，同齊行過白頭偕老ê甜蜜。日常情景看了，「台灣」tsit个主題永遠bē欠席，文學káng「台」專欄ê〈心聲〉來講看啥mi̍h tsiah是「台灣文學」？〈2021年228·0紀念行動宣言〉koh再一擺提醒lán逐家，228事件失--去--ê，m̄-nā性命niâ，lán ê語言、lán ê自信、lán對tsit phiàn土地ê認同，tsia--ê lóng是lán ài拍拚走揣，一點一tuh khioh--tńg--來ê寶貝。</span></p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjWI46etsUE8PzYLjt18mF_O5NTgGzmYz7K5D1MVtIfo-QhlqDXMGOzxQB1FKMMzHSPRAa7HtMKaRpw1zliRVWb2EuwHG5TKlpx8rPgxuzEShiESd3RC1i3d98La4CUw0k0Wl8IF2YQy0SN/s1424/324%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjWI46etsUE8PzYLjt18mF_O5NTgGzmYz7K5D1MVtIfo-QhlqDXMGOzxQB1FKMMzHSPRAa7HtMKaRpw1zliRVWb2EuwHG5TKlpx8rPgxuzEShiESd3RC1i3d98La4CUw0k0Wl8IF2YQy0SN/w450-h640/324%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span face=\"&quot;arial&quot; , &quot;helvetica&quot; , sans-serif\"><b>台文通訊BONG報324期，2021年3月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">有固定的長期捐款， 讓更多的台語文相關計畫可以穩定的推行，感謝逐家。</span></div><div><span></span><br /></div><div><span></span><br /></div><span></span><br /><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br /><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br /><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br /><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br /><span style=\"color: #38761d;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br /><div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div></div></div><div><br /></div>"
